 <h3><u>Ana majnoon al husain</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya aba abdillah..(2)<br> assalam alaika ya aba abdillah</p> 
  <p>majnoon al husain..(4)</p> 
  <p>ana majnoon al hussian..(2)<br> deewana e hussain hu<br> ana majnoon al hussian</p> 
  <p>Shabbir ka mai hu deewana..(2)<br> aa maut mujhe seene se laga<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Chehre ki siyahi noor bani<br> maqtal ki taraf jab jaun chala<br> aur aakhri lamhe me paaya<br> shabbir ke zaanu ka takiya..(2)<br> aaram mila jab dard utha..(2)<br> har zakhm ne milkar di ye sadaa<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Shabbir ke daste qudrat me<br> eesa se zeyada qudrat hai<br> hatho ka hunar fir kya hoga<br> gehware me jab ye taaqat hai..(2)<br> fitrus ne jo baalo par paaye..(2)<br> jhoole se lipat kar kehne laga<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Sar kab se rakha hai sajde me<br> tasbeeh ki kya tadaat hui<br> sajde me rasool e akram ko<br> thi fikr kaha in baato ki..(2)<br> jab tak ke nawasa pusht pe tha..(2)<br> kehta raha dil payghambar ka<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Jo maa ne sabaq samjhaya tha<br> har daur me usko yaad raha<br> abbas yahi dohrata hua<br> bachpan se jawani tak aaya..(2)<br> ghaazi ki zuba me kehta hai..(2)<br> ab tak ye alam lehrata hua<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Hum karbobala ke deewane<br> jab taziya lekar chalte hai<br> aashoor ke din bhukhe pyase<br> mazloom ka matam karte hai..(2)<br> gir gir ke sadae deta hai..(2)<br> behte hue khoo ka har qatra<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Tewar ye batate the uske<br> ae baniye shar ek teer hai kya<br> mai dhaal hu apne baba ki<br> lashkar ke tu saare teer chala..(2)<br> asghar ne tabassum ki surat..(2)<br> maqtal me rajas bas itna padha<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Pohcha jo dar e shabbir pe wo<br> marzi e shahe abraar mili<br> rumal e batool ki surat me<br> anmol use dastaar mili..(2)<br> ye faiz hai us ek jumle ka..(2)<br> jo hurr ne bawaqt e fajr kaha<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Gar aaj khuda ki janib se<br> kaabe ko ijazat miljae<br> makke ki zamee ko chhod ke wo<br> khud karbobala me a pohche..(2)<br> har waqt husain ke roze ka..(2)<br> ye padh ke tawaaf kare kaaba<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Socho to sahi ae meer hasan<br> lamhe wo bhala kese honge<br> jab bazm e imam e mehdi me<br> tum sher padhoge akbar ke..(2)<br> aur saath tumhare mehfil me..(2)<br> har shakhs yahi kehta hoga<br> ana majnoon al hussian..(2)</p> 
  <p>assalam alaika ya aba abdillah..(3)</p> 
